# GeoIP database (internal/platform/geoip/GEOIP_DB_PATH) — a real
# GeoLite2-Country.mmdb requires your own MaxMind account/license key
# (see .env.example) and its license restricts redistribution, so it's
# never committed. internal/platform/geoip/testdata/'s .mmdb is MaxMind's
# own public test fixture (not real geolocation data) and stays tracked.
*.mmdb
!internal/platform/geoip/testdata/*.mmdb
